   ('How do the [ADD], [IMP], [FIX] and [REF] tags differ?','[ADD] adds a new module or component, [IMP] is an incremental improvement, [FIX] fixes a bug and [REF] is a heavy refactor. There are also [REM] for removals, [REV] for reverts, [MOV] for moving files, [MERGE] for merge commits, [REL] for releases and [I18N] for translation files.'),
   ('Which branching strategy suits a client\'s Odoo project?','For small to mid teams start simple: one protected main branch, short-lived feature branches merged through merge requests, and a tag for every release. Add release branches or per-Odoo-version branches only when you must maintain several versions in parallel.'),
